$ ./v2ppt.exe -h
usage: v2ppt.exe [-h] [-bv BOOK_VERSION] [-b BOOK] [-c CHAPTER_NUM] [-v VERSE VERSE]
                 [--call2w] [--bold] [--bapt]

    ==================================================================
    V2PPT v2.1
      Output Bible verses to PPT by using default:CUNP1/ or RCUV1/
        NOTE: Make sure verse_bg.jpg and verseTemplate.pptx is in dir.
        NOTE: THe output name is : <Book>_<chapter>_<vstart>_<vend>.pptx
    ==================================================================


options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -bv, --book_version BOOK_VERSION
                        Which bible version: default:CUNP1/ or RCUV1/
  -b, --book BOOK       The name of the bible book: e.g. GEN/
  -c, --chapter_num CHAPTER_NUM
                        The chapter number.
  -v, --verse VERSE VERSE
                        The start and end verse.
  --call2w              Create call2 worship slide
  --bold                Enable bold font
  --bapt                Enable baptist sub

    OT :
      GEN EXO LEV NUM DEU JOS JDG
      RUT 1SA 2SA 1KI 2KI 1CH 2CH
      EZR NEH EST JOB PSA PRO ECC
      SNG ISA JER LAM EZK DAN HOS
      JOL AMO OBA JON MIC NAM HAB
      ZEP HAG ZEC MAL

    NT :
      MAT MRK LUK JHN ACT ROM 1CO
      2CO GAL EPH PHP COL 1TH 2TH
      1TI 2TI TIT PHM HEB JAS 1PE
      2PE 1JN 2JN 3JN JUD REV

    Examples:
      V2PPT -bv RCUV1|CUV1 -b <BookName> -c <chapter> -v <st_verse> <end_verse>
      V2PPT -bv RCUV1 -b GEN/ -c 1 -v 1 10
      Output name: GEN_1_1_10.pptx

      bapt = 洗或浸


$ ./announce.exe -h
